nated list card, the ",[321,330,331],{},"shuoUi"," site-wide settings and more. Once installed, type ",[321,334,335],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," in your agent's chat to invoke it: ",[338,339,87],"a",{"href":340},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fskills",[342,343,348],"pre",{"className":344,"code":345,"language":346,"meta":347,"style":347},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n","bash","",[321,349,350],{"__ignoreMap":347},[351,352,355,359,363,366],"span",{"class":353,"line":354},"line",1,[351,356,358],{"class":357},"sBMFI","npx",[351,360,362],{"class":361},"sfazB"," skills",[351,364,365],{"class":361}," add",[351,367,368],{"class":361}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[370,371,372,384],"ul",{},[373,374,375,376,379,380,383],"li",{},"Cursor can install it with one click from the \"Install Skill\" button on the docs page, Claude Code uses ",[321,377,378],{},"claude skill add",", and other tools can reference ",[321,381,382],{},"skills\u002Fshuo-ui\u002FSKILL.md"," on GitHub directly.",[373,385,386,387,390,391,394],{},"The skill files live in ",[321,388,389],{},"skills\u002Fshuo-ui"," of the public repo and are also published at ",[321,392,393],{},"\u002F.well-known\u002Fskills\u002F"," on the docs site. The package does not include them, so what you install is the same as 1.2.0.",[313,396,398],{"id":397},"llmstxt","📄 LLMs.txt",[304,400,401,402,410,411,418,419,422,423],{},"The docs site provides ",[338,403,407],{"href":404,"rel":405},"https:\u002F\u002Fk90325248.github.io\u002Fshuo-ui\u002Fllms.txt",[406],"nofollow",[321,408,409],{},"\u002Fllms.txt"," (an index of every page) and ",[338,412,415],{"href":413,"rel":414},"https:\u002F\u002Fk90325248.github.io\u002Fshuo-ui\u002Fllms-full.txt",[406],[321,416,417],{},"\u002Fllms-full.txt"," (the full documentation), and every page has a markdown version: add ",[321,420,421],{},".md"," to its URL. Give these URLs to tools such as ChatG